The jobs of one attempt of a run, as .github/scripts/leg-verdict.sh reads them (the same command,
with the run and the attempt written in). 50 a page: the command with per_page=100 answered every
read of 44852710105's attempt 2 with `gh: Server Error (HTTP 502)`, eight times in a row, while
per_page=50 and per_page=30 each answered with its 86 jobs.

  run-44852710105-attempt-1.jobs, run-44852710105-attempt-2.jobs, at 9d197d9b66: a run whose
  attempt 2 re-ran one job, `kind / rig`, which failed there and had passed in attempt 1. Attempt
  2's list holds all 86 jobs, each with run_attempt 2 and an id of its own, the ones it did not
  re-run with the result they had in attempt 1.

    gh api --paginate 'repos/cybermonklabs/legion/actions/runs/44852710105/attempts/1/jobs?per_page=50' \
